  "description": "<p data-end=\"272\" data-start=\"0\"><strong data-end=\"22\" data-start=\"0\">Brand Introduction</strong>:<br data-end=\"26\" data-start=\"23\">TheFaceShop is a leading Korean global cosmetics brand known for its natural ingredients and skincare solutions that blend traditional herbal remedies with modern technology. It offers a wide range of skincare, makeup, and personal care products.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"543\" data-start=\"274\"><strong data-end=\"297\" data-start=\"274\">Product Description</strong>:<br data-end=\"301\" data-start=\"298\">TheFaceShop provides high-quality, eco-friendly products made from natural ingredients such as herbs, fruits, and plants. The brand focuses on skincare essentials, including cleansers, moisturizers, masks, and serums, as well as makeup items.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"794\" data-start=\"545\"><strong data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"545\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong>:<br data-end=\"579\" data-start=\"576\">TheFaceShop stands out for its commitment to using natural ingredients, backed by advanced technology, offering effective skincare solutions suitable for all skin types, with a focus on environmental sustainability.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"991\" data-start=\"796\"><strong data-end=\"813\" data-start=\"796\">Payment Terms</strong>:<br data-end=\"817\" data-start=\"814\">Typically, TheFaceShop in KSA offers a variety of payment options, including credit/debit cards, online payments, and cash on delivery for both in-store and online purchases.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1227\" data-start=\"993\"><strong data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"993\">Other Information</strong>:<br data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"1015\">TheFaceShop has a strong presence in KSA through retail stores and online platforms, delivering a seamless shopping experience. It also frequently holds promotions and offers loyalty rewards for its customers.</p>",
